<title>GERMANY: Pan-German Sept CPI inflation unchanged at 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan-German Sept CPI inflation unchanged at 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN CPI INFLATION		Sept 96	Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.1	  -0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.4	  +1.4	 +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    116.8	 116.9	115.2</p>
<p> FINAL WEST GERMAN CPI INFLATION Sept 96	Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.1	  -0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.4	  +1.4	 +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    114.4	 114.5	112.8</p>
<p> EAST GERMAN CPI INFLATION	 Sept 96	Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 -0.2	  -0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year			    +1.6	  +1.8	 +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    135.7	 136.0	133.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>The Office gave the following details:</p>
<p>					    Mth/mth	     Yr/yr</p>
<p>				     Sept 98  Aug 96   Sept 96  Aug 96</p>
<p> Food, drink, tobacco	     -0.5    -0.5	+0.8    +1.1</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes		    +0.3    +0.1	+0.7    +0.7</p>
<p> Rents &amp; energy		     +0.5    +0.1	+2.0    +1.8</p>
<p> Of which: rents		    +0.2    +0.1	+2.7    +2.7</p>
<p>	     energy excl. fuel    +2.0    unch	-0.6    -1.8</p>
<p> Furniture, household goods     unch    +0.1	+0.7    +0.8</p>
<p> Health and body care goods     unch    unch	+2.0    +2.3</p>
<p> Traffic and news transmission  +0.1    +0.2	+1.8    +1.9</p>
<p> Education, leisure goods	 +0.3    +0.1	+1.0    +1.1</p>
<p> Personal equipment, others     -3.3    +0.2	+0.9    +1.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
